# Global Lead Intelligence & Sales Automation Pipeline

Complete 18-phase master development plan

## 1. The overall vision

We want to build an intelligent global business discovery and sales automation platform that can find businesses across different countries, collect their information, verify their details, enrich their profiles, organize them into a CRM, and eventually assist with the entire sales process.

Think of it as a combination of:

- Global business search engine.
- Business intelligence platform.
- Lead generation system.
- Data enrichment and verification engine.
- Personal CRM.
- AI sales assistant.
- Automated outreach and follow-up system.
- Sales analytics platform.

The objective is to create one integrated application instead of depending on several disconnected tools.

