# 3. How all 18 phases connect

This is the most important part of the architecture.

The phases are not 18 independent features. They form one continuous business intelligence and sales workflow.

## Complete system architecture

GLOBAL DATA SOURCES

Maps · Government registries · Websites · Directories · Social platforms

CONNECTOR & DISCOVERY ENGINE

Country framework · Connectors · Discovery · Collection

DATA PROCESSING ENGINE

Normalization · Deduplication · Enrichment · Verification

CENTRAL LEAD DATABASE & PERSONAL CRM

Business profiles · Contacts · Notes · Tasks · Sales pipeline

AI SALES INTELLIGENCE

Analysis · Scoring · Personalization · Recommendations

OUTREACH & AUTOMATION

Email · Permitted messaging · Follow-ups · Campaigns

CONVERSION & BUSINESS INTELLIGENCE

Sales results · Analytics · Market intelligence · Optimization

Security, reliability, monitoring and performance support every layer.

