Imagine opening the application and performing this workflow:

1. Select any supported country.
2. Select an industry and business category.
3. Search for real businesses.
4. Collect information from multiple permitted sources.
5. Merge duplicate business records.
6. Discover additional business information.
7. Verify contact information and company identities.
8. Store everything in the central CRM.
9. Let AI analyze and prioritize the leads.
10. Generate personalized sales pitches.
11. Launch permitted outreach campaigns.
12. Track responses.
